<title>UK: TENNIS - LATEST WIMBLEDON BETTING.</title>
<headline>TENNIS - LATEST WIMBLEDON BETTING.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Latest William Hill betting on the Wimbledon tennis championships after Tuesday's matches: Men's singles  6-4 Pete Sampras  5-1 Richard Krajicek  11-2 Goran Ivanisevic  13-2 Boris Becker  9-1 Yevgeny Kafelnikov 12-1 Greg Rusedski  14-1 Patrick Rafter  25-1 Tim Henman, Michael Stich 33-1 and upwards others</p>
<p>Women's singles 4-6 Martina Hingis 3-1 Monica Seles 8-1 Jana Novotna 10-1 Arantxa Sanchez-Vicario 16-1 and upwards others</p>
